---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Crypto Risk Desk — Archived BitEvo Concept" description="This legacy Crypto Risk Desk sales page is archived and is not a current BitEvo public offer." robots="noindex, follow">
  <section class="archive section">
    <div class="narrow archive-card panel">
      <div class="eyebrow">Archived concept</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Crypto Risk Desk is not a current public commercial offer.</h1>
      <p class="lede">The previous page mixed time-sensitive market claims, historical research metrics and legacy pricing. It has been retired rather than presenting stale numbers as current evidence.</p>
      <div class="notes">
        <div><span>Research</span><strong>Trading and risk material remains available as research notes.</strong></div>
        <div><span>Commercial</span><strong>The current public commercial focus is the Agent Authority & Evidence Audit.</strong></div>
        <div><span>Claims</span><strong>No live bot counts, performance claims or changing market metrics are asserted on this route.</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/guides">Open research library <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button" href="/agent-authority-audit">Current audit offer</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .archive{min-height:64vh;display:grid;place-items:center}.archive-card{padding:clamp(34px,7vw,72px);text-align:center}.archive-card .page-title{margin-inline:auto}.archive-card .lede{margin:22px auto 30px}.notes{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}.notes div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.notes span{color:var(--green);font:500 .62rem var(--mono)}.notes strong{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}
</style>
